  "sourceTitle": "Deploying real-time personalized speech with Qwen3-TTS on Amazon SageMaker AI",
  "sourceBodyHash": "dc8164d20e214c58a33993dbd87fd9e069e8d763c97b4507b4629c282d3a2358",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-25T20:44:20.852762Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T15:32:16.722274Z",
  "totalBlocks": 95,
  "translatedBlocks": 71,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e900f714a9613bf6",
      "translationZh": "通过声音克隆，您可以在无需重新训练模型的情况下，通过一段简短的参考录音，以目标说话者的声音生成新的语音。现在，您可以将来自 Amazon SageMaker JumpStart 的公开可用的 Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base 文本转语音模型部署到完全托管的实时推理端点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "674661675be96f93",
      "translationZh": "声音克隆可以复制特定说话者的声音特征。首先使用说话者的简短录音及其转录文本，然后提供要合成的新文本。模型无需重新训练即可用参考说话者的声音朗读该文本。媒体团队、教育工作者和应用开发人员可以使用此功能来创建个性化的语音体验并实现多语言内容的本地化。他们还可以支持无障碍沟通，并在不同语言之间保留说话者的身份特征。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "217df5d00a9349e0",
      "translationZh": "通过使用自托管的公开可用声音克隆模型，您可以控制成本并将音频数据保留在您的 AWS 环境中。您还可以使模型适应您的特定领域。通过 Amazon SageMaker AI，您可以在完全托管的实时端点上运行模型，并处理基础设施配置、健康监测和自动扩缩容。您无需管理底层的 GPU 服务器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbb69fdbe2c65814",
      "translationZh": "本文展示了如何使用 Amazon SageMaker Python SDK 从 Amazon SageMaker JumpStart 部署 Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base，以及如何调用生成的端点从参考片段中克隆声音。它还涵盖了使此部署在实践中生效的配置设置，以及可用于监控和调整端点规模的 Amazon CloudWatch 指标。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "261fddfde33e8e40",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3-TTS 是由阿里云 Qwen 团队开发的公开可用的文本转语音模型系列。它涵盖 10 种语言：中文、英语、日语、韩语、德语、法语、俄语、葡萄牙语、西班牙语和意大利语。这些模型使用 Qwen3-TTS-Tokenizer-12Hz 语音分词器，并支持流式生成，以适用于低延迟的交互式场景。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a03e12b0f54b9afe",
      "translationZh": "本文使用的是 Base 版本，即 Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base。它仅需几秒钟的用户音频即可进行声音克隆。它也可以作为微调的基础。对于声音克隆，模型接收一段参考音频片段及其转录文本。它会捕捉说话者的声音特征，如音色、音调和节奏，并将其应用于新文本。这与 CustomVoice 版本不同，后者是从一组固定的预定义说话者中生成语音，而不是使用用户提供的参考。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59ba8d5b7673fd59",
      "translationZh": "该模型还支持跨语言克隆：您可以从一种语言的参考中捕捉声音，并在保留说话者声音特征的同时，生成另一种语言的语音。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f24d8cc6077fa8c",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base 与 Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-CustomVoice 和 Qwen3-ASR-1.7B 一起在 Amazon SageMaker JumpStart 中提供。通过这些 JumpStart 选项，您可以使用本文所示的简化部署流程。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d93f40debc78db46",
      "translationZh": "通过声音克隆，应用程序可以从参考录音中复制所选说话者的声音特征，而不是局限于一组预定义的固定声音。这为媒体、客户参与、教育和对话式 AI 等领域的各种用例提供了支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5afae5177555b00f",
      "translationZh": "这种部署方式的主要优势包括：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d9cc935776b2fb6",
      "translationZh": "大规模个性化：您可以通过一段短样本生成目标声音的语音，而无需收集庞大的训练数据集。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "20e396820184bec3",
      "translationZh": "多语言覆盖：您可以使用一种语言采集的声音在保留身份特征的同时，生成另一种语言的语音。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "508ff8aaa1c5aecd",
      "translationZh": "成本效率：部署方式使成本与计算使用量挂钩，而不是按字符计费的 API 定价。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7cbd38da947cc722",
      "translationZh": "数据控制：数据保留在您的 AWS 账户以及您管理的 Amazon SageMaker 端点内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "49a770040950fe10",
      "translationZh": "应用用例",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35a1b597776e3310",
      "translationZh": "声音克隆的常见应用包括：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "668bcf86aa4d9d51",
      "translationZh": "内容本地化：您可以在将内容翻译成多种语言的同时，保留原演讲者的音色。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6eab927b840cc152",
      "translationZh": "客户体验：联络中心和虚拟助手的响应可以使用一致的品牌语调。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13cce50e19b1db67",
      "translationZh": "在线学习与有声读物：您可以以特定讲师或作者的音色呈现长篇内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1af9791c38e0e84e",
      "translationZh": "创意原型设计：您可以在录音室制作之前测试对话和配音。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da57318cbb9e3386",
      "translationZh": "实时对话式人工智能：流式语音识别和低延迟合成可以支持交互式语音代理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0ac1605670f0440",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案将 Qwen3-TTS-12Hz-1.7B-Base 从 Amazon SageMaker JumpStart 部署到实时端点。JumpStart 提供模型构件和预构建的服务容器，因此您无需编写自定义推理处理器。您需要构建一个 JumpStartModel 对象，调用其 deploy 方法，并使用 Amazon SageMaker 运行时客户端调用生成的端点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "030539c1de1ce2de",
      "translationZh": "JumpStart 容器提供模型服务，以从文本输入生成 24 kHz 音频输出。如下节所述，这一阶段设计会影响您如何规划 GPU 显存大小。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed2be31fa6aeaef2",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了该部署的实时推理架构。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a94800c4d74d68e",
      "translationZh": "一个具有创建 Amazon SageMaker 模型、端点配置和端点权限，以及调用端点权限的 AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 身份。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50bfedbb60ae981f",
      "translationZh": "一个 Amazon SageMaker Studio 环境、一个 notebook 实例，或者一个安装了 Amazon SageMaker Python SDK 的本地环境。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "340f8259a49dfd93",
      "translationZh": "受支持的 GPU 实例的充足服务配额。本演练使用 ml.g6.4xlarge (1x NVIDIA L4 GPU, 24 GB)，这对于 1.7B 模型来说是足够的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4e6758ce8a5c041c",
      "translationZh": "一段目标说话者的简短参考音频剪辑（几秒钟即可）以及其中所说内容的转录文本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dce0fb32a84feb0a",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：从 JumpStart 部署模型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5025bbe6459839d3",
      "translationZh": "使用模型 ID 构建一个 JumpStartModel 并进行部署。GPU 显存覆盖（GPU memory override）是此次部署最重要的设置。下一节将解释如何进行配置。在运行以下代码之前，请将 <sagemaker-execution-role-arn> 替换为 Amazon SageMaker AI 用于部署模型的 IAM 执行角色的 ARN。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "986b34d99b282fdf",
      "translationZh": "在容器将模型加载到 GPU 的过程中，端点需要几分钟时间才能达到 InService 状态。您可以通过 Amazon SageMaker AI 控制台或通过调用 describe_endpoint API 来监控端点状态。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "68e3aee7a81c1919",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：正确设置 GPU 显存大小",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f64518d92859946",
      "translationZh": "如前所述，该模型在同一块 GPU 上分两个阶段（talker 和 code2wav）运行。vLLM 会根据 gpu_memory_utilization（即一个阶段可以占用的 GPU 显存比例）预先保留 GPU 显存。两个阶段共享一块 GPU。为了避免启动期间出现显存溢出（out-of-memory）错误，请确保它们的总预留量在 GPU 容量范围内。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de1055db41750d7a",
      "translationZh": "设置该值以使两个阶段能够舒适地共同容纳。如果对两个阶段应用相同的共享设置，0.45 是一个不错的选择（0.45 + 0.45 = 0.90，留出约 10% 的缓冲）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e919b5cd8cfa47b",
      "translationZh": "在容器启动时，每个阶段都会将其显存使用情况记录到 Amazon CloudWatch Logs 的端点日志组中。以下数值确认了模型可以很好地适配 24 GB 的 GPU：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca4ca61efdec86d3",
      "translationZh": "模型加载占用了 3.66 GiB 显存，耗时 0.81 秒",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af0ec2d383e3c0c6",
      "translationZh": "模型加载占用了 0.45 GiB 显存，耗时 4.73 秒",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46d1883f673286aa",
      "translationZh": "Talker KV 缓存已预留",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c5b6c5f8a4a7c3a",
      "translationZh": "可用 KV 缓存显存：6.08 GiB",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77ddbc4856ff8df8",
      "translationZh": "Talker KV 缓存 Token 预算",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59a506928b0fb94d",
      "translationZh": "GPU KV 缓存大小：56,928 个 token",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e96356bd409fa6b",
      "translationZh": "模型权重很小（talker 为 3.66 GiB，code2wav 为 0.45 GiB）。每个阶段允许使用的剩余大部分内存都变成了 KV 缓存，即用于保存正在进行的请求中的 token 的工作内存。在 24 GB GPU（约 22 GiB 可用）上，利用率为 0.45 时，每个阶段最多可以使用大约 10 GiB。两个阶段加在一起可以放入 GPU 中，并留有余量。这就是为什么 24 GB GPU 非常适合 1.7B 模型，而不需要更大的 GPU。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "25b3a06ff76631c9",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：测试端点",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93a549775c6e93eb",
      "translationZh": "使用 InService 端点测试声音克隆。有两个细节是专门针对此 JumpStart 容器的，对于获取响应至关重要：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b30f3881320bfa9f",
      "translationZh": "路由选择：Amazon SageMaker 端点暴露单个 /invocations 路径，该容器默认将其路由到其 completions 处理程序。要到达文本转语音处理程序，您必须传递自定义属性 route=/v1/audio/speech。如果不传递，请求将被拒绝。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e852ad4a598af0d",
      "translationZh": "有效负载结构：使用 OpenAI speech schema，并将 task_type 设置为 \"Base\" 以进行声音克隆，并包含参考剪辑的 URI 及其转录文本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f8637425351d004",
      "translationZh": "音频格式。将参考剪辑作为 base64 编码的 data:audio/wav;base64,... URI 提供。建议在编码前将参考剪辑转换为 24 kHz 单声道 WAV 格式。端点会以您通过 response_format 请求的格式返回音频。本文使用 \"wav\"，模型会生成 24 kHz 单声道音频。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f93db8129f98b25c",
      "translationZh": "以下代码将参考剪辑进行转换并进行 base64 编码：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2ae1af86c6ce2a0c",
      "translationZh": "为单个句子克隆声音",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e1904654aae39ed3",
      "translationZh": "在 input 中传入目标文本，并在 ref_audio 中传入参考音频来调用该端点。请注意 CustomAttributes 路由参数，这是到达文本转语音处理器的必要参数：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8c1c365b58def2c",
      "translationZh": "前面的请求是最基础的情况：将一句文本以克隆声音的形式作为语音返回。接下来的模式在此基础上进行构建，使用相同的 ref_audio、ref_text 和 route 自定义属性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b86f878f4e8e094",
      "translationZh": "本示例的样本音频（请打开本文提供的文件）：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e62f6a9d3df0739",
      "translationZh": "参考输入：reference_original_input.wav",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f1ca23ce52662de",
      "translationZh": "生成输出：cloned_output.wav",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "068a9e8438018240",
      "translationZh": "单个请求适用于单个句子或短句。对于较长的内容，例如文章或多行剧本，请将其拆分并按句子或段落发送请求，以确保整个过程中的声音保持一致。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7ed08280ebedefc0",
      "translationZh": "使用另一种语言生成语音（跨语言克隆）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c189e970973d8b4",
      "translationZh": "若要在保持相同音色的同时生成不同语言的语音，请使用相同的参考音频片段，并将“language”设置为另一种受支持的语言。以下示例使用英文参考音频来生成中文语音，从而在不同语言之间保留说话者的声音特征。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d156d9e9990b8e27",
      "translationZh": "生成的输出：cross_lingual_cloning.wav",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "814871ec07c5d68e",
      "translationZh": "选择实例并针对您的流量进行扩展",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c88eeb98b07eeba",
      "translationZh": "分三步选择实例。首先，确认 JumpStart 支持该实例。然后，检查您的服务配额并确认其 GPU 显存能够容纳该模型。对于一个 1.7B 参数的模型，24 GB GPU（g6 系列，NVIDIA L4）是匹配良好且具有成本效益的选择。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51c1a24e730bca5e",
      "translationZh": "要估算并发请求容量，请检查 Amazon CloudWatch Logs 中端点日志组内的 KV cache token 预算。日志组路径为 /aws/sagemaker/Endpoints/<endpoint-name> 。在容器启动时，您会看到如下行：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c9010f5e8bb7008",
      "translationZh": "该值是以 token 为单位测量的总 KV cache 容量。它代表了预留缓存可以在并发请求中持有的总 token 计数。将此预算除以平均请求大小，即可估算并发容量。由于 TTS 请求通常较短，单个实例可以容纳多个同时进行的请求。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc7adbc19e3ac38b",
      "translationZh": "对于更高的流量，请增加端点实例或选择具有更多 GPU 容量的实例类型。Amazon SageMaker AI 自动扩展可以根据需求调整实例数量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "01ef5dee4d4259cc",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon CloudWatch 监控端点",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "833a7ab51e9be41c",
      "translationZh": "调用（请求）指标",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9219ff67069104bd",
      "translationZh": "命名空间 AWS/SageMaker，具有相同的维度：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "128a2b1ad0888997",
      "translationZh": "查看使用 Sum 统计值的 Invocations，以查看一段时间内的总请求数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b7c732c2a507a47",
      "translationZh": "发送到端点的请求数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d21236eec3041b5",
      "translationZh": "发送到端点后每个实例的请求数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "676ad5434bd8c31c",
      "translationZh": "正在并发处理的请求数。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4a473a9670cc2dc",
      "translationZh": "从 SageMaker AI 视角来看，模型响应所需的时间，单位为微秒。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
